    "body": "> Not use git stash as a dumping ground.\r\n\r\nHaha, I usually tend to do the same.\r\n\r\nThe first example should work, did it not for you?\r\n\r\n```console\r\n~/P/r/rust-book-examples on  master [?] is 📦 v0.1.0 via 🦀 v1.39.0-nightly\r\n💥 gsl\r\nstash@{0}: WIP on master: a04d488 Add Chapter 15\r\n\r\n~/P/r/rust-book-examples on  master [?] is 📦 v0.1.0 via 🦀 v1.39.0-nightly\r\n🚀 cat ~/.config/starship.toml\r\n[hostname]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[character]\r\nsymbol = \"🚀\"\r\nerror_symbol = \"💥\"\r\nuse_symbol_for_status = true\r\n\r\n[directory]\r\nfish_style_pwd_dir_length = 1\r\n\r\n[git_status]\r\nstashed = \"\"\r\n```",
